{"total_count":389,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/transformers/commits/98386dcee94655b20d9a1b1c9b9e63019e249db4","sha":"98386dcee94655b20d9a1b1c9b9e63019e249db4","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MTU1MjIwNjQxOjk4Mzg2ZGNlZTk0NjU1YjIwZDlhMWIxYzliOWU2MzAxOWUyNDlkYjQ=","html_url":"https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/commit/98386dcee94655b20d9a1b1c9b9e63019e249db4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/transformers/commits/98386dcee94655b20d9a1b1c9b9e63019e249db4/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/transformers/git/commits/98386dcee94655b20d9a1b1c9b9e63019e249db4","author":{"date":"2025-07-30T00:03:17.000+09:00","name":"Minseo Kim","email":"75977640+luckyvickyricky@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"date":"2025-07-29T08:03:17.000-07:00","name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"},"message":"🌐 [i18n-KO] Translated `main_classes/peft.md` (#39515)\n\n* docs: ko: main_classes/peft.md\n\n* feat: nmt draft\n\n* docs: add missing TOC to documentation for `PeftAdapterMixin` section\n\nAdded a table of contents (TOC) to the documentation, specifically for the `transformers.integrations.PeftAdapterMixin` section, following the structure and content outlined in [this link](https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/main_classes/peft#transformers.integrations.PeftAdapterMixin).\n\n* fix: Improve naturalness of purpose expression in Korean\n\nChanged '관리하기 위한' to '관리할 수 있도록' for more natural Korean expression when describing the purpose of providing functions.\n\n* fix: Simplify plural form and make expression more concise\n\nChanged '~할 수 없기 때문에' to '~할 수 없어' for more concise expression while maintaining clarity.\n\n* fix: Replace technical term '주입' with more natural '적용'\n\nChanged '주입할 수 없어' to '적용할 수 없어' for better readability.\nConsidered alternatives:\n\n'삽입': Too literal translation of 'inject'\n'입력': Could be misunderstood as data input\n'통합': Implies merging two systems\n'추가': Simple but less precise\n\n'적용' was chosen as it's the most natural and widely used term in Korean technical documentation for this context.\n\n* fix: update toctree path for PEFT to lowercase\n\nChanged the toctree path from 'PEFT' (uppercase) to 'peft' (lowercase) to match the correct directory naming convention and prevent broken links.\n\n* docs: update as per reviewer feedback after rebase","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/transformers/git/trees/40bcf2bde0401f23bd6115b70473a01681f377e9","sha":"40bcf2bde0401f23bd6115b70473a01681f377e9"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"nevertmr","id":75977640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTc3NjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75977640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr","html_url":"https://github.com/nevertmr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevertmr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gis